@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam classFontSize 10
skinparam componentFontSize 10
skinparam arrowFontSize 9
hide circle
title QAPM Android Component - System Architecture

package "Android Host Application" {
    [Android Application Integrator]
    [Network Instrumentation Integrator]
}

package "QAPM SDK" {
    package "Background Scheduling" {
        [Main Thread Handler] as MTH
        [Work Handler Manager] as WHM
        [Background HandlerThread] as BHT
        [Work Handler] as WH
    }

    package "Upload Processing" {
        [Upload Processor] as UP
        [Network Connectivity Gate] as NCG
        [Storage Pop Module] as SPM
        [File Enumerator] as FE
        [Parameter Deriver] as PD
    }

    package "Data Sender" {
        [QAPM Configuration Manager] as QCM
        [Configured Sender] as CS
    }

    package "HTTP Instrumentation" {
        [Response Handler Wrapper] as RHW
        [Transaction State] as TS
        [Response Entity Wrapper] as REW
        [Counting InputStream] as CIS
    }

    package "Local Storage" {
        [Upload Directory] as UD
        [Upload Files] as UF
    }

    package "External Dependencies" {
        [Android Context] as AC
        [Apache HttpClient] as AHC
        [Network State] as NS
    }
}

' ==== Relationships and Data Flows ====

' **Background Scheduling**
WHM --> BHT : creates/starts
WHM --> WH : creates from looper
MTH --> WHM : accesses
WH --> WH : enqueues work

' **Upload Processing Flow**
UP --> NCG : checks
NCG --> NS : queries connectivity
UP --> SPM : invokes (if forced)
SPM --> UD : pops data before scan
UP --> FE : triggers enumeration
FE --> UD : scans directory
FE --> UF : reads files
UP --> PD : triggers derivation
PD --> AC : derives cParam
UP --> QCM : requests sender
QCM --> CS : provides sender
UP --> CS : submits bParam, cParam
CS --> UP : returns success/failure
UP --> UF : deletes on success

' **HTTP Instrumentation Flow**
RHW --> TS : inspects/instruments
RHW --> AHC : wraps ResponseHandler
RHW --> AHC : delegates handling
REW --> AHC : wraps HttpEntity
REW --> CIS : provides/manages
CIS --> AHC : reads from wrapped entity
REW --> AHC : delegates writeTo

' **External Integrations**
[Android Application Integrator] ..> WHM : uses scheduling
[Android Application Integrator] ..> UP : triggers upload
[Network Instrumentation Integrator] ..> RHW : uses wrapper
[Network Instrumentation Integrator] ..> REW : uses wrapper
AC ..> PD : provides context
NS ..> NCG : provides state
AHC ..> RHW : provides handler to wrap
AHC ..> REW : provides entity to wrap
UD ..> FE : provides path
UF ..> FE : provides content

' **Component Dependencies (Non-Functional)**
note top of WH : NFR-001: Async execution
note top of NCG : NFR-002: Skips if no network
note top of REW : NFR-003: Rejects null entity
note top of UP : NFR-005: Separated steps

' **Constraints**
note right of WHM : C-001: Android APIs
note right of RHW : C-002: Apache HttpClient
note right of UP : C-003: Network & File dependent
note bottom of QCM : C-004: Broader pipeline out of scope

@enduml
